@ZelaFix_HostAddress = http://localhost:5034

### Health Check Geral
GET {{ZelaFix_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login JWT (Cidadão Padrão Semeado)
POST {{ZelaFix_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cidadao@zelafix.com.br",
  "senha": "Password123!"
}

### Login JWT (Gestor Municipal Padrão Semeado - RBAC GestorOnly)
POST {{ZelaFix_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gestor@zelafix.com.br",
  "senha": "Password123!"
}

### Categorias Oficiais
GET {{ZelaFix_HostAddress}}/api/v1/categorias
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar Chamados Paginados
GET {{ZelaFix_HostAddress}}/api/v1/chamados?page=0&size=10&incluirFoto=true
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
